\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\">\\(\\mathcal O\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSequence}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSequence}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>；集合性质作用于序列时依以下关系或已有共同oracle接口解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Low}_n(A)\\Longleftrightarrow A^{(n)}\\equiv_T\\varnothing^{(n)},\\qquad\\operatorname{High}_n(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing^{(n+1)}\\le_TA^{(n)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Low}_n(A)\\Longleftrightarrow A^{(n)}\\equiv_T\\varnothing^{(n)},\\qquad\\operatorname{High}_n(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing^{(n+1)}\\le_TA^{(n)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Low}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Low}_1(A),\\qquad\\operatorname{High}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{High}_1(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Low}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Low}_1(A),\\qquad\\operatorname{High}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{High}_1(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对任意集合，高性是∅″≤TA′；仅当A≤T∅′时可改写为A′≡T∅″。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：§5.9, §5.11.3 and §5.13, print pp.29–30,44,54–57 / PDF pp.49–50,64,74–77。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Asser